OL,3,GNEWSANorfolk speedway set me on path to
OL,4,Aworld title
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe newly-crowned world champion of
OL,7,Fspeedway has credited his home county
OL,8,Fclub with setting him on the path to
OL,9,Fsuccess.
OL,11,FNorwich-born Robert Lambert, 28, lifted
OL,12,Fthe trophy after winning the final
OL,13,FGrand Prix of the season in Torun,
OL,14,FPoland, on Saturday.
OL,16,FHe first began riding professionally in
OL,17,Fthe UK for King's Lynn Stars in Norfolk
OL,18,Fas a teen, having initially honed his
OL,19,Fcraft in Germany.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
