OL,3,GNEWSANorfolk speedway set me on path to
OL,4,Aworld title
OL,5,
OL,6,F"King's Lynn has been a massive,
OL,7,Fmassive part of my career," he told BBC
OL,8,FLook East presenter Amelia Reynolds.
